ce_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n给定<MATH_0001>，可以问：若纤维（fibre）范畴（category）<MATH_0002>是群胚（groupoid），对所有<MATH_0003>均如此，则<MATH_0004>是否必然在群胚（groupoids）中纤维化（fibred）于<MATH_0005>之上？如下可见，答案是否定的。从群胚纤维化范畴（category fibred in groupoids）<MATH_0006>开始。对于<MATH_0007>中的态射（morphisms），改变其中那些不映（map）到某个对象（object）的恒等态射（identity morphism）的，不会改变范畴（categories）<MATH_0008>。因此，可以破坏提升（lifts）的存在性（existence）及唯一性（uniqueness）条件。一个例子是例<REF_0001>中的函子（functor），其中<MATH_0009>并非满射（surjective）。下面再给出一个例子。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:68eb75228dc7308abd0966716dcabb3ff31d625173366bcbf49665c1ff12ccb2", "unit_id": "tag:003S:prose-0003", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "给定函子的各纤维；待决。", "source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"context": "假定为群胚的纤维范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "对每个纤维的假设；待决。", "source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "所询问的整体纤维化性质；待决。", "source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"context": "整体纤维化的群胚条件；待决。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "反例构造开始时的范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category fibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚纤维化范畴"}, {"context": "被改变的非纤维态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "投影函子作用在态射上；待决。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映"}, {"context": "基底对象的恒等态射；待决。", "source_term": "identity morphism", "target_term": "恒等态射"}, {"context": "基底中的对象；待决。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "改变之后保持的纤维范畴；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "提升的存在条件；待决。", "source_term": "existence", "target_term": "存在性"}, {"context": "提升的唯一条件；待决。", "source_term": "uniqueness", "target_term": "唯一性"}, {"context": "定义中所要求的提升；待决。", "source_term": "lifts", "target_term": "提升"}, {"context": "群同态所诱导的例子函子；待决。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "该例子中不满足的满射条件；待决。", "source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}]}
